# id: extract_v1
# version: 1.0
# technique: Zero-shot baseline (one-line instruction)
# why: Control condition for comparative prompting. No role, no constraints, no examples,
#      no data delimiters, so we can measure what the engineered prompt (v2) adds.
=== SYSTEM ===
You are a helpful assistant.
=== USER ===
Extract the medicines from this prescription as JSON {{"medications": [...]}} with keys name, dose, route, frequency, duration, instructions.

{prescription}
